</picture>
  


          </div>
        </div>
      

      
        <div class="
          glue-grid__col
          glue-grid__col--span-4-sm
          glue-grid__col--span-12-md
          caption
          --center
        ">
          <p data-block-key="osvwz"><i>Time-series leaderboard showing weekly forecasting performance for teams participating in the COVID-19 Forecast Hub, ordered by absolute average WIS (number within each cell). Scores are aggregated across 52 jurisdictions and four forecast horizons. The cell’s background color visualizes the performance relative to the CovidHub-ensemble, with blue indicating a lower (better) WIS and red indicating a higher (worse) WIS. Our method, the top row of the table (Google Retrospective) outperforms CovidHub-ensemble.</i> <a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-research2023-media/images/AI-powered-empirical_software-leaderboard.original.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i>Click</i></a><i> to enlarge image.</i></p>
        </div>
      
    </div>
